THINK does trk-link-1 carries trk-link-2
THINK need track_loop: Tread links wrapped round wheels: spreads weight, lets the machine roll or be driven. Rules: Link count must fit the wheel spacing so the loop is tight. Idler wheels on frictionless pins or free axles.
THINK why Wide links with two clips each can be snapped together by hand; 30 links is the right length to go round the sprockets and rollers.
THINK role trk-link-1 in the tracks: Track link: one of 60 links of the loop; teeth of the sprockets sit in it.
